{% extends "layouts/page.njk" %}

{% block pageTitle %}{{ pageTitle }}{% endblock %}

{% block beforeContent %}
  {{ backLink({href: backLinkPath}) }}
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<div class="govuk-grid-row">
  <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds-from-desktop">

    <h1 class="govuk-heading-l">{{ pageHeading }}</h1>

    <p class="govuk-body">You need a Defra account to request to use the nature restoration levy and to view your commitment certificate. A Defra account lets you register with a range of online services from Defra and related organisations. You sign in to it with GOV.UK One Login or Government Gateway.</p>

    <p class="govuk-body">You cannot create a Defra account as an agent or third party working on behalf of someone else. You need to get the organisation you’re representing to create the account, if they do not already have one, and invite you to it as an intermediary.</p>

    {{ govukWarningText({
      text: "The Defra account must belong to the organisation you are representing. If you create the account yourself, the commitment certificate will be registered to you rather than your client and will not be valid.",
      iconFallbackText: "Warning"
    }) }}

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">What your client needs to do</h2>

    <p class="govuk-body">Your client needs to create a Defra account, if they do not already have one, and invite you to it as an intermediary.</p>

    <ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number">
      <li>They <a href="#" class="govuk-link">sign in to, or create, a Defra account</a> using GOV.UK One Login or Government Gateway.</li>
      <li>They invite you to the account as an intermediary in the 'Manage account users' section.</li>
      <li>They give you access to the nature restoration levy service.</li>
    </ol>

    {% set inviteHtml %}
      <p class="govuk-body">The first person to register for a Defra account will be the account admin. They can invite and remove other team members or third parties and manage the account. They can also give admin rights to other team members.</p>
      <p class="govuk-body">We recommend there are at least 2 account admins to prevent issues accessing and managing the account.</p>
    {% endset %}
    {{ govukDetails({
      summaryText: "How to invite other people to join a Defra account",
      html: inviteHtml
    }) }}

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Before you start</h2>

    <p class="govuk-body">Once you have been invited, you sign in with your own One Login or Government Gateway user ID and password. If you do not have a One Login or Government Gateway account, you can create one in the next step.</p>

    <div class="govuk-button-group">
      {{ govukButton({
        text: "Continue",
        href: continuePath
      }) }}
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
